{"metadata":{"title":"PersistentTrees","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"PersistentTrees"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"PersistentTrees","roleHeading":"Framework"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeSet","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeDictionary","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" never changes a vertex once it is made."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An edit builds new vertices along the path from the root to the change, O(log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":") of them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"points them at the untouched subtrees of the version it started from. Every earlier version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays as it was, and a history of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" edits costs O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") space in all."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import PersistentTrees","","let empty = PersistentTreeSet<Int>()","let one = empty.inserting(5)","let two = one.inserting(3)","let three = two.removing(5)","Array(one)                         \/\/ [5]","Array(two)                         \/\/ [3, 5]","Array(three)                       \/\/ [3]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The trees are weight-balanced: neither subtree of a vertex holds more than three times the keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the other. Union, intersection, difference and symmetric difference split one tree by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s root and join the halves, in O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}]},{"type":"text","text":" + 1)) for sets of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"m"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ≤ "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" elements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a subtree both operands share is kept whole without being visited. Two versions a few edits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apart therefore merge in time proportional to those edits."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A version converts to Grafluent’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryTree(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", its elements or keys as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Balanced search trees that keep every version, sharing structure between them."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/persistenttrees"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeSet","doc:\/\/PersistentTrees\/documentation\/PersistentTrees\/PersistentTreeDictionary"],"anchor":"Sets-and-dictionaries","title":"Se